<title>USA: Superconductor Technologies amends offering.</title>
<headline>Superconductor Technologies amends offering.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superconductor Technologies Inc said Tuesday it had filed an amendment to its registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to modify its public offering to 1.5 million shares of common stock from 2 million shares.</p>
<p>The underwriter has also been granted an option to purchase an additional 225,000 shares solely to cover over-allotments, of which 125,000 have been allocated to a selling stockholder. The underwriter for the amended offering is Van Kasper &amp; Co.</p>
</text>
